Package: ch9344-dkms
Version: 2.3.1-2
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, make, gcc
Recommends: proxmox-default-headers | linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-amd64
Maintainer: GlobaLTE <g.pesin@globalte.ru>
Description: DKMS driver for WCH CH9344 and CH348 USB multi-serial adapters
 Vendor WCH V2.3 driver with GlobaLTE receive-path stability fixes,
 packaged for Debian, Ubuntu and Proxmox VE.
 Supports USB IDs 1a86:e018 (CH9344) and 1a86:55d9 (CH348/CH348Q).
